{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/hy5g8wyismm24us2wb2br9sf1afuvvy.mp3","text":"博士，今日的战场与往日相比太脆弱、太稚嫩了，这会让武器生锈。一旦武器生锈，战士离死亡也就不远了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/hqn9cfton3si0ojh1ltrfybd8k21hv8.mp3","text":"生命只是湮灭之前的一小段历程，趁你还能看见舷外的夕阳，好好珍惜吧，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/lcfxlu60a0wl4zjgo30oq2p68u5izsi.mp3","text":"实战演习？我没有兴趣。罗德岛不乏强大的战士，然而，在游戏中挥霍体力只是无谓的浪费。只有在生死交错的刹那，我们的刀与剑才有相互碰撞的价值。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/88/71ebsszcq99knstgdgpythjvu8avme3.mp3","text":"不关心感染者的境遇？不要误会，我不过是讨厌徒劳的战斗。真正值得我流血的敌人还没出现，仅此而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/ftc0smb3hlj6zs1qarndb7n15pj3u59.mp3","text":"团队合作会夺去全力厮杀所解放出的本能，用信任与谋略换来一些平稳的幻觉。而幻觉会取走你的性命，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/dbc0vllbqn84upvvb8kur91xakzbfqe.mp3","text":"这把刀，枭首了两位亲王，而另一把刺死了三个将军。混乱的大地上，什么事情都有可能发生。我不知道我的命会被谁拿去，只希望过程会比我刺杀那些人时更精彩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/km22ll7tnm7wr0lhq9t0m1815v7r3uz.mp3","text":"闪灵吗，可惜，她原本可以是个很强的敌手，只是在“赦罪师”们卷入那种事情以后，就连她也觉得自己的剑刃沾满了污秽吧。不信任自己武器的剑士不值一提。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/27/m969cgofjhv0z82h8zvm70t9au9v7m6.mp3","text":"你知道那场战争吧，博士。杀死所有伏击者后，我和残存的部下冲进了背叛者的堡垒，最后活下来的只有我一个人。这场战斗究竟因何而起？你很清楚，我见过你，而且我记性很好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/4a171swjst77xetfxbxlaacolukgue6.mp3","text":"博士，帮我拿一下柜子上的种子，谢谢。是，其实我喜欢花。无论它们的绽放有多么灿烂，最后花瓣也都会在风中凋零枯萎。下一次花期是什么时候呢，博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/fnb5k79xnhoajb4arlfxyug37f74hqx.mp3","text":"警醒能延续你的生命，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/a1hcu8rdy3cfp8hrx50sqshu8f333ak.mp3","text":"又见面了，博士。不要紧，我知道你现在的情况，也对你没有威胁。请把我当做武器来运用，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/71x3w31nc86b6zizaiqxaoirj16newn.mp3","text":"一个优秀战士渴求的技艺是没法被记录下来的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/jbvwrzl9nf68knzbymoik7z9ue442gg.mp3","text":"晋升？原来你也会在意这种事情。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/o3w3gb8kuw1l9j1dtiopm4mqws1eobn.mp3","text":"我没有作为感染者的自觉。也许罗德岛能给我一点提示，我不在乎，但你们有自己的考量。我接受。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/dj3az3az40v7n6ehmf6z3v10nakb69p.mp3","text":"啊，久违的腥风血雨。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/qe76qb3cqmigkxr3hrlb11poq6ueose.mp3","text":"我做过队长，下场不怎么好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/b7j5fdssuns62lrc3eyfnsi5tf3v749.mp3","text":"我将浴血。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/8iss76veycpvd7aif74tph88bwtromr.mp3","text":"开始吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/il7iaqwksu9evql6a7r7r7chh6idhlp.mp3","text":"不要插手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/l4t4h5k3is5meqzi8rv850juk6kmwx4.mp3","text":"做你该做的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/qjn9zkasmikl0ry6asr7280uzwsu30t.mp3","text":"那么，谁来做我的对手？","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/o3axkswasfu11q3hot79ms40lur361p.mp3","text":"是你吗？还是你？","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/j4frpe5ud1o653jxt0uva7utg05u3bn.mp3","text":"刀与火，先行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/57/nrxeuya1ek3kgbvwjruja2uaikmfqkm.mp3","text":"血与骨，后至。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/6lim6ji87fvhfyqpah5ii29khw7wz6m.mp3","text":"你死时会呼唤谁的名字？","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/22/j8m0b7n9eicavcmgvfoompof1lrbcks.mp3","text":"与我无关。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/ibk0y064kedlzmowd0uopfq9p8el5v5.mp3","text":"这场战斗满足你了吗，博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/9sb8e9s2708wsxbmsbgotwtzy0p4p4k.mp3","text":"羸弱的敌人证明不了什么，去寻找更严苛的战场吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/m6ufup6b1zcdmjpr8ai8p2rxikbmogr.mp3","text":"适当的手下留情也许会成为孵化强敌的契机，就随他们去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/4q37hmlsmrb35pacmrdx3yaqaaqh8fr.mp3","text":"你们走吧，消灭追兵这种事，向来是我去做的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/gd47i0o5gwp5rihnaaaspw42yu8dk79.mp3","text":"挺安静的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/5zdfvwy4kcr37xpjtjv1hok5ae3ddwg.mp3","text":"哦？","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/k8hc6xnenha1a4ned63zxw3cvtg97xu.mp3","text":"砥石似乎用完了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/qfv5ll4iue64rnkgmed0i2lmk8ouei0.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/gfp1ry5cpa1elvlx2nw56vh8lwfbv7z.mp3","text":"时间不断推移，如果你在这段旅程中没有进步，你的岁月就会像枯老的树木那样腐朽，失去重新迎接春天的能力。新年快乐，博士，不要忘记自己的目标。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/1reljj87q6fvpvk8gqxh8xr1teybvn0.mp3","text":"不错，你还活着。","alt":"voice_cn/char_131_flameb/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/7m050wn7kfy7y83whs94grbk1c34m6s.mp3","text":"博士，今日的战场与往日相比太脆弱、太稚嫩了，这会让武器生锈。一旦武器生锈，战士离死亡也就不远了。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/ac39yhgymh7f1o6bzuviabkmfoswf7n.mp3","text":"生命只是湮灭之前的一小段历程，趁你还能看见舷外的夕阳，好好珍惜吧，博士。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/10vx06xmang1l4z658arzpn4ag4mr91.mp3","text":"实战演习？我没有兴趣。罗德岛不乏强大的战士，然而，在游戏中挥霍体力只是无谓的浪费。只有在生死交错的刹那，我们的刀与剑才有相互碰撞的价值。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/hf7qb7djb3wwq3u7kap8acmkwm3plme.mp3","text":"不关心感染者的境遇？不要误会，我不过是讨厌徒劳的战斗。真正值得我流血的敌人还没出现，仅此而已。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/dzo53jdxvmg5wjaoqqifu4qp0i831fd.mp3","text":"团队合作会夺去全力厮杀所解放出的本能，用信任与谋略换来一些平稳的幻觉。而幻觉会取走你的性命，博士。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/0ej85ftb5dgyv7zzggj75rpg6k3jrzc.mp3","text":"这把刀，枭首了两位亲王，而另一把刺死了三个将军。混乱的大地上，什么事情都有可能发生。我不知道我的命会被谁拿去，只希望过程会比我刺杀那些人时更精彩。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/my0lmah1q42a9te4li6c9ga0pkqbznd.mp3","text":"闪灵吗，可惜，她原本可以是个很强的敌手，只是在“赦罪师”们卷入那种事情以后，就连她也觉得自己的剑刃沾满了污秽吧。不信任自己武器的剑士不值一提。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/hsehnr65mnnwu659rspo26vbuoji8no.mp3","text":"你知道那场战争吧，博士。杀死所有伏击者后，我和残存的部下冲进了背叛者的堡垒，最后活下来的只有我一个人。这场战斗究竟因何而起？你很清楚，我见过你，而且我记性很好。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/epjc8pqr3hcdgrng76o4pkojv1rg4o4.mp3","text":"博士，帮我拿一下柜子上的种子，谢谢。是，其实我喜欢花。无论它们的绽放有多么灿烂，最后花瓣也都会在风中凋零枯萎。下一次花期是什么时候呢，博士？","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/sjf243o7io2mh6n4wqrsnf07ur577at.mp3","text":"警醒能延续你的生命，博士。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/9xxiwv14pxnt1avcl9n3h1s6ksxpsbe.mp3","text":"又见面了，博士。不要紧，我知道你现在的情况，也对你没有威胁。请把我当做武器来运用，博士。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/0wvnp9qdefr1kxkq4c4l303315tqpea.mp3","text":"一个优秀战士渴求的技艺是没法被记录下来的。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/blumrnubko7ro99xs0e5cdrq9idovuz.mp3","text":"晋升？原来你也会在意这种事情。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/m3p53sim0o9vb4fh25nr7ivpe8g3fvn.mp3","text":"我没有作为感染者的自觉。也许罗德岛能给我一点提示，我不在乎，但你们有自己的考量。我接受。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/t41u9tjl5ud2vjcyw8wff1zdq04iymc.mp3","text":"啊，久违的腥风血雨。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/ae2pjyzkc92n7bwbp5fkjtj8nrhk9ep.mp3","text":"我做过队长，下场不怎么好。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/3fwhgrb5xocdl69fg4hy9m2prhv4hli.mp3","text":"我将浴血。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/f3zprfcx82mlz4su14mn3yu8bxsfifz.mp3","text":"开始吧。","alt":"voice/char_131_flameb/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/mzlefo71drq4fd7pjfyuys3x3cgxueu.mp3","text